# Farmer UI — production / Capacitor builds (`npm run build`)
#
# Dev server (`npm run dev`) ignores this and proxies /api → http://127.0.0.1:8000 (see vite.config.ts).
# For Xcode / WKWebView you MUST set a reachable absolute URL or the app only sees “demo” offline data.
#
# Copy to “.env.production.local” for a persistent release URL (file is gitignored).
#
# Simulator + backend on same Mac:
# VITE_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# Physical iPhone (same Wi‑Fi): use your Mac’s LAN IP and run:
#   uvicorn backend.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000
# VITE_API_BASE=http://192.168.x.x:8000
#
# TestFlight / production:
# VITE_API_BASE=https://your-api.example.com
